  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.692 New Hampshire’s emergency services reporting (NHESR)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.692 “New Hampshire’s emergency services reporting (NHESR)” means the NH EMS electronic database, that meets the requirements of NEMSIS, provided by the division to all EMS units and providers to record EMS incidents.\n\nSource. #14328, eff 7-23-25, EXPIRES: 7-23-35",
